  "mechanisms": [
    "Early visual processing mediates aesthetic judgments.",
    "The most preferred images contain structure to which the human visual system is most sensitive.",
    "Aesthetic judgments are a function of processing fluency; quicker and more efficient processing leads to more positive aesthetic judgment.",
    "Aesthetic perception is an interaction between an artwork's objective properties and the observer's processing characteristics.",
    "Beauty is an emergent property in the brain of the beholder, linked to functional characteristics of the visual brain."
  ],
